<title>USA: Harte-Hanks to buy back up to 5 pct stock.</title>
<headline>Harte-Hanks to buy back up to 5 pct stock.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harte-Hanks Communications Inc said its board has approved a stock repurchase program of up to 1.8 million shares of its common stock, representing about five percent of its outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The repurchases will be effected through open market purchases and privately negotiated transactions, Harte-Hanks said.</p>
<p>It said it anticipates repurchased shares will be available for employee stock option and stock purchase plans.</p>
</text>
